#
# Regular (weak) German verb endings for tools/data/complete-paradigms.py; see
# it.paradigms. Strong verbs change their stem (fahren → fährst, ging):
# their forms are left as the wordlist has them, and a generated form that
# differs from an existing word only by an umlaut (fahrst/fährst) is skipped.

spell e-after-dt-before-st-t        # arbeiten → arbeitest, arbeitet
spell drop-s-after-sz-before-st     # reisen → du reist (not reisst)

class en en end
tense present: e st t en t en
tense past: te test te ten tet ten

class ern n nd stem=er|el
tense present: e st t n t n
tense past: te test te ten tet ten
